Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.71,DAD,,0,0,0,,PHONE. NOW. THEN PANCAKES.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.91,0:00:03.06,SKYE,,0,0,0,,HI, MOM. SO. FUNNY STORY.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.07,0:00:06.93,MAX,,0,0,0,,SO. THE HALLOWEEN DANCE. DO
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.93,0:00:08.32,MAX,,0,0,0,,YOU WANT TO GO? WITH ME?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.43,0:00:09.87,SKYE,,0,0,0,,ARE YOU ASKING ME, OR IS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.87,0:00:11.08,SKYE,,0,0,0,,THE FRIDGE ASKING ME?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.08,0:00:12.55,LILY,,0,0,0,,THE FRIDGE SAYS YES.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.19,SKYE,,0,0,0,,FINE. ONE CONDITION.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.39,0:00:15.72,MAX,,0,0,0,,NO CRUSTS?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.93,SKYE,,0,0,0,,NO CRUSTS.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.93,0:00:18.53,DAD,,0,0,0,,PANCAKES FOR EVERYONE! INCLUDING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.53,0:00:20.54,DAD,,0,0,0,,THE GHOST! ESPECIALLY THE GHOST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.47,0:00:22.79,VO,,0,0,0,,I SPENT A WEEK TRYING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.79,0:00:24.00,VO,,0,0,0,,TO SCARE MY ENEMY.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.98,VO,,0,0,0,,HE SPENT IT MAKING ME SANDWICHES.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.28,0:00:28.44,VO,,0,0,0,,SUBSCRIBE TO VIRAL ROBLOX GAMES
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.44,0:00:30.25,VO,,0,0,0,,FOR MORE STORIES LIKE THIS.
